            "review_title": "Review at Gia Vien",
            "review_text": "Ginnyleeinwonderland\nHai Phong, Vietnam340 contributions\n0\nBig restaurant and wedding center\nFeb 2018 • Business\nLast time I was there, my agency hold a big events in their biggest hall. It was the same hall where my brother got married. The hall was huge and nice with nice decoration, big stage and screen. They have places for small group of guesses, for holding wedding and for big events. The food was nice and delicious. But everytime my agency ordered the same kind so I didn't know what other food tasted like. They were reallt common food such as steamed shrims, chicken soup, sweet rice, roasted duck with honey, steak, etc. I tried to have coffee in the yard and garden area once. The drinks was not really special but it was nice.\nRead more\nWritten September 7, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
